        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦆 A stupidly fun hide-and-seek  game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in every level… there’s a duck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll hear it quack every few minutes, but finding it? That’s up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore bizarre maps, uncover weird secrets, and maybe — just maybe — survive whatever else is out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as a silly game of “Where’s the duck?” quickly becomes something… stranger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔍 Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ handcrafted levels that get bigger, weirder, and more difficult</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rubber duck that quacks every few minutes to give you a hint — or lure you in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden scares and disturbing surprises across the maps (don’t say we didn’t warn you)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of comedy and horror — just enough to make you laugh and look over your shoulder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat, no time limits — just you, your wits, and a duck that refuses to sit still</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦆 A stupidly fun hide-and-seek  game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in every level… there’s a duck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll hear it quack every few minutes, but finding it? That’s up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore bizarre maps, uncover weird secrets, and maybe — just maybe — survive whatever else is out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as a silly game of “Where’s the duck?” quickly becomes something… stranger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔍 Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ handcrafted levels that get bigger, weirder, and more difficult</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rubber duck that quacks every few minutes to give you a hint — or lure you in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden scares and disturbing surprises across the maps (don’t say we didn’t warn you)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of comedy and horror — just enough to make you laugh and look over your shoulder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat, no time limits — just you, your wits, and a duck that refuses to sit still</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
